sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Auditor as User / Auditor
    participant UI as React 18 Frontend
    participant Server as Express Server
    participant Ctrl as Blockchain Controller
    participant Service as Ledger Verification Service
    participant DB as Relational Database

    Auditor->>UI: Navigate to Verify Page (or Speak "Verify Blockchain")
    UI->>Server: GET /api/blockchain/:electionId/verify
    Server->>Ctrl: verifyBlockchain(req, res)
    Ctrl->>Service: verifyBlockchain(electionId)
    Service->>DB: SELECT * FROM blockchain_blocks ORDER BY block_index ASC

    Note over Service: 1. Verify Genesis Block (Index=0, prev_hash=64 zeros)
    Note over Service: 2. Loop Through Blocks [1..N]:
    Note over Service:    a. Validate index continuity: block[i].index == i
    Note over Service:    b. Validate pointer continuity: block[i].prev_hash == block[i-1].curr_hash
    Note over Service:    c. Recalculate block[i].curr_hash using canonical fields
    Note over Service: 3. Verify total votes == non-genesis blocks

    alt All Hashes and Pointers Match
        Service-->>Ctrl: { isValid: true, status: "Ledger integrity verified", totalBlocks, issues: [] }
        Ctrl-->>UI: HTTP 200 JSON Response
        UI-->>Auditor: Display 100% Cryptographic Verification & Voice Speaks Confirmation
    else Discrepancy Found (e.g., After Tamper Simulation)
        Service-->>Ctrl: { isValid: false, status: "Previous-hash mismatch / Integrity failed", issues: [...] }
        Ctrl-->>UI: HTTP 200 Verification Report with Flagged Blocks
        UI-->>Auditor: Display Red Tamper Warning with Specific Broken Block Index
    end
